*** Add File:terraform/evidence/README.md
+Terraform module to provision evidence infrastructure required by Aegis.
+
+This module creates:
+- S3 evidence bucket (with versioning)
+- KMS key for object encryption and cosign usage
+- IAM role/policy for CI/callers to upload artifacts
+
+Usage:
+  - Populate provider (AWS) credentials in environment or CI (recommended).
+  - Customize variables in terraform.tfvars or call the module from your root config.
+
+Security notes:
+ - Tighten IAM principals and restrict access to the evidence bucket by principle of least privilege.
+ - Consider enabling S3 Object Lock / retention for long-term evidence immutability if required by compliance.
+
