+Instructions to run MPC integration test in Kubernetes staging
+
+1) Ensure crypten-worker image is built and pushed: ghcr.io/<org>/crypten-worker:latest
+2) Apply headless service, statefulset and RBAC:
+   kubectl apply -f ops/secure_agg/production_mpc/k8s/crypten-headless-service.yaml
+   kubectl apply -f ops/secure_agg/production_mpc/k8s/worker_statefulset.yaml
+   kubectl apply -f ops/secure_agg/production_mpc/k8s/crypten-rbac.yaml
+3) Generate test mTLS certs (staging only): ops/secure_agg/production_mpc/generate_mtls.sh /tmp/mpc_ca
+4) Create secret with certs: kubectl -n aegis create secret generic crypten-mtls --from-file=/tmp/mpc_ca
+5) Launch test job: kubectl apply -f ops/secure_agg/production_mpc/tests/test_mpc_k8s_job.yaml
+6) Tail logs and inspect output: kubectl -n aegis logs job/crypten-mpc-test
+
